# Omniverse Performance

This repo is a high-level performance guide for **Omniverse Kit** and **OpenUSD**. When asked any performance-related question (loading time, FPS, memory, GPU crash, FSD/UJITSO, USDRT, Scene Optimizer, etc.), follow the routing in [AGENTS.md](mdc:AGENTS.md).

## How to use this repo

[AGENTS.md](mdc:AGENTS.md) at the repo root is the single source of truth for which skill to apply when. It maps user questions to one of the 12 self-contained skills under `skills/<name>/SKILL.md`. Read AGENTS.md first; it has the routing table.

Each skill is self-contained and current as of the latest revision in `docs/`. Prefer the synthesized Do's, Don'ts, and decision tables in the skill before reading the longer prose chapters in `docs/`.

